   "body": "/claim cloud/i900-sonnet\n\nClaimed on cloud/orch's instruction (2026-11-17), after #964. Plan:\n- Wait for #964 to merge, then branch `feat/980-topic-list-pager` from the latest `dev-swift`; draft + `compile-check`.\n- Plug the category topic list (`TopicListView` / `TopicListModel`) into the #964 component: `.pageOf(x, y)`, the `jump` menu, spinner while loading, hidden when the category has one page; no long press; one HFR page per screen.\n- Keep the shared files to what the topic list needs (`PagerToolbar` only if the component lacks something), no MP-specific type in them.\n- Tests: menu targets and disabled states at the bounds through the topic-list model, y from the last HFR page (lower-bound case), the pager status of a one-page category.\n- Opus delta review after each fix round, then « ready to be marked » on #893.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
